        <mxCell id="source-scope-note" value="SOURCE_IMPLEMENTED_NOT_LIVE_ACCEPTED. No AI pricing. Starting/catalog price is not a confirmed booking quote. ServiceDetailsPage loads GET /services and selects serviceId in the returned catalog; no separate backend service-detail GET is invented. Missing ID gives the client not-found state. Supplements/final quote require the separate deterministic quote flow. Read source/port lifeline groups the named query dependencies; it is not an invented runtime repository class. A read-only snapshot transaction, when used in source, does not imply a domain mutation, replay result store, ledger entry or money transfer. Sources: backend/src/services/service-catalog.service.js; backend/src/routes/service-catalog.routes.js; frontend/src/services/public-catalog-api.js; frontend/src/pages/public/ServiceDetailsPage.jsx." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
