        <mxCell id="source-scope-note" value="PARTIAL_SCOPE_OR_ACCEPTANCE. Current offered/assigned reads are distinct. Legacy SitterVisitService.detail requires an injected repository and does not expose private address. Home access notes use a separate time-window read, never unconditional disclosure to an offered sitter. Read source/port lifeline groups the named query dependencies; it is not an invented runtime repository class. A read-only snapshot transaction, when used in source, does not imply a domain mutation, replay result store, ledger entry or money transfer. Sources: backend/src/services/sitter-offer.service.js; backend/src/services/care/assigned-care.service.js; backend/src/services/sitter-visit.service.js; backend/src/routes/employee-scheduling.routes.js." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
