        <mxCell id="source-scope-note" value="DESIGN_PENDING_RUNTIME. AssignedCare.get is sitter-only and provides owner-declared care instructions, not a Customer report read. Report readiness requires actual completion/checklist/media source; no fabricated care evidence. Read source/port lifeline groups the named query dependencies; it is not an invented runtime repository class. A read-only snapshot transaction, when used in source, does not imply a domain mutation, replay result store, ledger entry or money transfer. Sources: backend/src/services/care/assigned-care.service.js; backend/src/services/settlements/booking-finance-source.service.js." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
