        <mxCell id="source-scope-note" value="SOURCE_IMPLEMENTED_NOT_LIVE_ACCEPTED. Customer booking detail is a read only. Stored payment amount/state is not proof of a new provider payment. Refresh careShifts/checkInAt/checkOutAt from source; optional travel GET is separately owner/window/consent/freshness guarded. No arrival/check-in is inferred from map coordinates. Read source/port lifeline groups the named query dependencies; it is not an invented runtime repository class. A read-only snapshot transaction, when used in source, does not imply a domain mutation, replay result store, ledger entry or money transfer. Sources: backend/src/services/booking-proposals/booking-checkout.service.js; backend/src/routes/booking-checkout.routes.js; backend/src/controllers/booking-checkout.controller.js." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
