        <mxCell id="source-scope-note" value="PARTIAL_SCOPE_OR_ACCEPTANCE. This legacy per-source read is separate from employee PayrollService.own and approved FT/PT salaries; it does not calculate new compensation, equal tip split or execute external payout. Read source/port lifeline groups the named query dependencies; it is not an invented runtime repository class. A read-only snapshot transaction, when used in source, does not imply a domain mutation, replay result store, ledger entry or money transfer. Sources: backend/src/services/dashboards/earnings.service.js; backend/src/services/dashboards/mongo-earnings.repository.js; backend/src/services/dashboards/read-projection.js; backend/src/routes/earnings.routes.js." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
